  "description": "YITAMOTOR Universal Skid Steer Mount Quick Tach Conversion Adapter Plate is compatible with most Bobcats, Kubota tractors & loaders, and is widely used in agriculture, industry, and construction.\nFitment\nCompatible with most Bobcats, Kubota tractors & loaders, and widely used in agriculture, industry, and construction.\nFeatures\n12\" LONGAdjustable Cross Brace: The quick attach adapter has a retractable length of 12\"; 34\"-46\" length range makes it highly versatile for the fronts of your Bobcats, for Kubota tractors, or loaders\n4000 LBS WEIGHT CAPACITY: With a weight capacity of 4000 lbs, this quick conversion skid steer adapter helps you to easily transport parts, bales, pallets, and building materials\nEASY TO SOLDER: The quick tach adapter plate has a large flat surface for easy soldering so you can quickly solder it to your equipment and speed up installation\nROBUST MATERIAL: Our skid steer quick attach plate is made from 8MM thick robust material to ensure sturdiness and durability, also features a sandblasting surface for rust protection.\nWIDE COMPATIBILITY: The quick skid steer adapter is a multifunctional accessory that enjoys extensive compatibility with most Bobcats, for Kubota tractors & loaders.",
